/*!
\page page_stfstrawit StFstRawHit

\ref StFstRawHit stores the raw, per-channel ADC readout for a single strip in the Forward
Silicon Tracker (FST) for one event.  It is the pre-clustering hit object (digi) and holds all
time-bin ADC samples before clustering into \ref StFstHit objects.

\note \ref StFstRawHit inherits from \ref StObject, <b>not</b> from \ref StHit, because it
is a raw channel readout rather than a reconstructed space point.

\see StFstHitCollection

\section sec_fstraw_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\verbatim
StObject
└── StFstRawHit
\endverbatim

\section sec_fstraw_electronics Electronics Layout

From <tt>StFstConsts.h</tt>:

- <tt>kFstNumRdos = 6</tt> (RDO boards, 1–6)
- <tt>kFstNumArmsPerRdo = 3</tt>
- <tt>kFstNumApvChannels = 128</tt>
- <tt>kFstNumElecIds = 36864</tt> (electronics IDs, 0–36863)
- <tt>kFstNumTimeBins = 9</tt>
- <tt>kFstDefaultTimeBin = 2</tt>
- <tt>kFstMaxAdc = 4096</tt>

\section sec_fstraw_members Data Members

- <tt>Int_t mChannelId</tt> — Electronics channel ID (0–36863).
  Encodes RDO, ARM, APV, and channel within APV.
- <tt>Int_t mGeoId</tt> — Geometry ID (0–36863).
  Encodes disk, wedge, R-strip, and φ-strip.
- <tt>Int_t mSeedhitflag</tt> — Seed-hit flag: 0 = not a seed hit, 1 = seed hit.
- <tt>Float_t mCharge[9]</tt> — ADC values per time bin.
  Physics mode: pedestal- and CMN-subtracted.  Calibration mode: raw ADC.
  Default-initialized to −999.
- <tt>Float_t mChargeErr[9]</tt> — Charge uncertainty per time bin.
- <tt>UChar_t mMaxTimeBin</tt> — Time bin index with maximum ADC (0-based, 0–8).
- <tt>UShort_t mIdTruth</tt> — MC truth Geant track ID; 0 = background in embedding.
- <tt>static UChar_t mDefaultTimeBin</tt> — Default time bin index (class-wide, initialized to 2).

\section sec_fstraw_decode Geometry Decoding from mGeoId

| Method | Description | Range |
|--------|-------------|-------|
| <tt>getDisk()</tt> | Disk number | 1–3 |
| <tt>getWedge()</tt> | Wedge number | 1–36 |
| <tt>getPhiStrip()</tt> | φ-strip index | 0–127 |
| <tt>getRStrip()</tt> | R-strip index | 0–7 |

\section sec_fstraw_elec Electronics Decoding from mChannelId

| Method | Description | Range |
|--------|-------------|-------|
| <tt>getRdo()</tt> | RDO board | 1–6 |
| <tt>getArm()</tt> | ARM board index | 0–2 |
| <tt>getApv()</tt> | APV chip index | 0–15 |
| <tt>getSensor()</tt> | Sensor index | 0–2 |
| <tt>getChannel()</tt> | Channel within APV | 0–127 |

\section sec_fstraw_methods Key Methods

- <tt>int getChannelId() const</tt> — Electronics channel ID.
- <tt>int getGeoId() const</tt> — Geometry ID.
- <tt>int getSeedhitflag() const</tt> — Seed-hit flag (0 or 1).
- <tt>float getCharge(int tb = 0) const</tt> — ADC value for time bin <tt>tb</tt>.
- <tt>float getChargeErr(int tb = 0) const</tt> — Charge error for time bin <tt>tb</tt>.
- <tt>unsigned char getMaxTimeBin() const</tt> — Max-ADC time bin index.
- <tt>unsigned short getIdTruth() const</tt> — MC truth Geant track ID.
- <tt>static unsigned char getDefaultTimeBin()</tt> — Current default time bin.
- <tt>void setCharge(float, int tb = -1)</tt> — Set ADC value for time bin (<tt>tb == -1</tt> → default bin).
- <tt>template&lt;typename Container&gt; void setCharges(const Container&)</tt> — Overwrite all time-bin charges.
- <tt>static void setDefaultTimeBin(int)</tt> — Set class-wide default time bin.
- <tt>void Print(int nTimeBins) const</tt> — Print decoded geometry and charge values.

\section sec_fstraw_ownership Object Ownership

\ref StFstRawHit does not use a custom memory pool.  Objects are heap-allocated.  Ownership
belongs to the collection that holds them.
\warning Do <b>not</b> <tt>delete</tt> \ref StFstRawHit pointers obtained from a collection.

\section sec_fstraw_usage Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
StFstCollection* fstColl = event->fstCollection();
if (!fstColl) return;

for (int iWedge = 1; iWedge <= 36; ++iWedge) {
    const StSPtrVecFstRawHit& rawHits = fstColl->rawHits(iWedge);
    for (const StFstRawHit* rawHit : rawHits) {
        unsigned char disk   = rawHit->getDisk();     // 1–3
        unsigned char wedge  = rawHit->getWedge();    // 1–36
        unsigned char rStrip = rawHit->getRStrip();   // 0–7
        unsigned char phi    = rawHit->getPhiStrip(); // 0–127

        float charge = rawHit->getCharge(); // default time bin
        for (int itb = 0; itb < kFstNumTimeBins; ++itb)
            float adc = rawHit->getCharge(itb);

        bool isSeed = (rawHit->getSeedhitflag() == 1);
    }
}
\endcode

*/
